# AstroPrecise — Cloudflare Pages production policy.
# The source tree deliberately contains a non-deployable candidate placeholder.
# The protected release workflow replaces it with the exact verified commit in
# dist/_headers; a direct upload of website/ must therefore fail public proof.
# Re-test every directive on the deployment URL and both custom domains.
#
# The policy matches current product behavior: same-origin geolocation is used
# by sky/chart features, and contact.html posts to Formspree. The dormant PayPal
# SDK origin remains allowlisted, but checkout is currently a hosted link-out.
# Inline boot/style snippets still require 'unsafe-inline'; unsafe-eval is not
# allowed. The BYOK panel accepts a custom endpoint, so an endpoint outside the
# explicit connect-src list will be blocked if this policy is activated.
# See also: tools/setup-cloudflare-cache.mjs

/*
  X-Coherence-Candidate-Tip: __ASTROPRECISE_CANDIDATE_SHA__
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  X-Frame-Options: DENY
  X-Permitted-Cross-Domain-Policies: none
  Referrer-Policy: strict-origin-when-cross-origin
  Strict-Transport-Security: max-age=31536000; includeSubDomains
  Cross-Origin-Opener-Policy: same-origin-allow-popups
  Cross-Origin-Resource-Policy: same-site
  Origin-Agent-Cluster: ?1
  Permissions-Policy: accelerometer=(), camera=(), geolocation=(self), gyroscope=(), magnetometer=(), microphone=(), payment=(), usb=()
  Content-Security-Policy: default-src 'self'; base-uri 'self'; object-src 'none'; frame-ancestors 'none'; script-src 'self' 'unsafe-inline' https://www.paypal.com https://www.paypalobjects.com https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com; style-src 'self' 'unsafe-inline'; img-src 'self' data: blob: https://www.paypal.com https://www.paypalobjects.com; font-src 'self' data:; connect-src 'self' https://list.astroprecise.app https://services.swpc.noaa.gov https://qrng.anu.edu.au https://geocoding-api.open-meteo.com https://api.open-meteo.com https://api.openai.com https://openrouter.ai https://api.gumroad.com https://www.paypal.com; media-src 'self'; worker-src 'self' blob:; manifest-src 'self'; form-action 'self' https://formspree.io https://list.astroprecise.app; frame-src 'self' https://www.paypal.com; upgrade-insecure-requests
